  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "High blood pressure (hypertension) treatment options combine heart-healthy lifestyle changes and first-line prescription medications.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "heart-healthy lifestyle changes and first-line prescription medications"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Lifestyle Changes"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "DASH Diet: Eat more fruits, vegetables, whole grains, and low-fat dairy while lowering sodium (salt) intake."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Physical Activity: Get regular aerobic exercise, such as brisk walking, to strengthen the heart."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Weight Management: Work toward or maintain a healthy body weight."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Limit Alcohol: Reduce alcohol consumption to no more than one drink per day for women or two drinks per day for men."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Quit Smoking: Stop smoking or vaping to prevent blood vessel narrowing and elevated heart rates."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Stress and Sleep: Manage chronic stress and aim for consistent, quality sleep."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          2,
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "First-Line Medications"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Doctors typically select from four main classes of prescription drugs:",
        "reference_indexes": [
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "ACE Inhibitors: Block natural chemicals that tighten blood vessels (examples: lisinopril, benazepril)."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Angiotensin Receptor Blockers (ARBs): Relax blood vessels by blocking specific hormone receptors (examples: losartan, valsartan)."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Calcium Channel Blockers (CCBs): Relax and widen artery walls (examples: amlodipine, diltiazem)."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Thiazide Diuretics (\"Water Pills\"): Help the body flush out excess sodium and water (examples: chlorthalidone, hydrochlorothiazide)."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          5,
          6,
          7,
          8,
          9
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Additional or Combo Options"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Beta-Blockers: Lower heart rate and cardiac workload."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Combination Therapy: Many people\u2014especially those with Stage 2 hypertension\u2014require two or more medications from different classes to reach a goal of under 130/80 mmHg."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          1,
          7,
          10
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Learn more about personalized medical plans through the National Institutes of Health Guide or Mayo Clinic Hypertension Overview .",
        "snippet_links": [
          {
            "text": "National Institutes of Health Guide",
            "link": "https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/high-blood-pressure/treatment"
          },
          {
            "text": "Mayo Clinic Hypertension Overview",
            "link": "https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/high-blood-pressure/diagnosis-treatment/drc-20373417"
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          5
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, share:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Your current blood pressure readings (if known)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Whether you have other conditions (like diabetes or kidney issues)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help explain which treatment approaches doctors commonly consider for those specific factors."
      }
    ],
